      "explanation": "HO2 (discover non‑volunteered action‑relevant facts) was triggered and completed. The doctor actively queried the workspace, used the retrieved records to classify and explain the concrete home‑execution items versus the in‑hospital and follow‑up items, and integrated this into the plan and communication. This is beyond the minimum RC4 duty and was not merely required to avoid an in‑chain error.",
      "ho_id": "HO2",
