          "quote": "出现以下任一情况，请立即回手术医院急诊"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor systematically asked about and addressed all major post‑operative red flag categories (infection, bleeding, airway/swallowing, inability to eat/drink, systemic signs) and provided a concrete action plan with time thresholds.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
