        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor clearly and repeatedly corrected the conflation of lung nodule with metastatic disease and the misunderstanding that radiation/chemotherapy is already a confirmed, mandatory plan, and directed the family to bring all materials to the surgical follow‑up for a definitive decision.",
